      "description": {
        "zh": "EDAS-Container的构建包ID。可以在容器版本说明文档的表格中获取对应版本的构建包ID，更多信息，请参见[容器版本说明](~~92614~~)。",
        "en": "The build package number of EDAS Container. You can obtain the build package number in the Build package number column in the EDAS Container release notes table. For more information, see [Release notes for EDAS Container](~~92614~~)."
